<title>USA: Massachusetts Mutual names Pajak president/COO.</title>
<headline>Massachusetts Mutual names Pajak president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mass. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Massachusetts Mutual Life Insurance Co said on Thursday that it named John Pajak as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He replaces David Sams, who served as president and coo following the merger of MassMutual and Connecticut Mutual Life Insurance Co.</p>
<p>Pajak was formerly vice chairman and chief administrative officer, and serves on MassMutual's board and its Investment and Dividend Policy committees.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
